        "passed": true,
        "score": 1.0,
        "rationale": "The agent correctly targeted Transformer 1 at MAIN, retrieved stats for oti, oti_a, oti_t, il1, il2, il3 and inut (min/max/mean all match the iot.sensor_stats output), pulled iot.history with the relevant sensors to align timestamps, identified the peak-oti timestamp (2024-01-16, 87 \u00b0C) and the peak total-current timestamp (301 A, also 2024-01-16 and again 2024-01-18), and correctly stated they match while appropriately caveating the tiny load variation. The phase-imbalance calculation is arithm",
        "details": {
          "task_completion": true,
